

### Vector-Addition Coefficients

(Wigner coefficients or Clebsch-Gordan coefficients)

#### 27.9.1 Definition

\[(j_{1}j_{2}m_{1}m_{2}|j_{1}j_{2}jm) = \delta(m,m_{1} + m_{2})\cdot\sqrt{\frac{(j_{1} + j_{2} - j)!(j + j_{1} - j_{2})!(j + j_{2} - j_{1})!(2j + j_{1} + j_{2} + 1)!}}\] \[\cdot \sum_{k}\frac{(-1)^{k}\sqrt{(j_{1} + m_{1})!(j_{1} - m_{1})!(j_{2} + m_{2})!(j_{1} - m_{2})!(j - m_{1})!(j - m_{2})!}}{k!(j_{1} + j_{2} - j - k)!(j_{1} - m_{1} - k)!(j_{2} + m_{2} - k)!(j - j_{2} + m_{3} + k)!(j - j_{1} - m_{2} + k)!}\] \[\delta(i,k) = \left\{ \begin{array}{l}1,\;\;\dot{\epsilon} = k\\ 0,\;\;\dot{\epsilon} \neq k\end{array}\right.\]

